  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a transverse wave travelling along a string is $y(x, t)=4.0 \\sin \\left[20 \\times 10^{-3} x+600 t\\right] \\mathrm{mm}$, where $x$ is in mm and $t$ is in second. The velocity of the wave is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "uK0Wh",
      "text": "$-60 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5jP9L",
      "text": "$-30 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "SfzPM",
      "text": "$+30 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c0Wjo",
      "text": "$+60 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& k=20 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~mm}^{-1}=20 \\mathrm{~m}^{-1} \\\\\n& w=600 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1} \\\\\n& v=\\frac{W}{k}=\\frac{600}{20}=30 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}\n\\end{aligned}$\nand $x \\& t$ carry same sign\nTherefore $\\mathrm{v}=-30 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
    "image": null
  },
